<http://data.silknow.org/object/b8e89245-ff4b-32e5-bbe7-87eff0b51f9b>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Man's court waistcoat, 1795-1800, English; ivory silk, embroidered coloured silks"@en , "Man’s court waistcoat with a 2-inch (5 cm) standing collar, straight fronts and skirts reaching to the top of the hip. There are no pockets, only a pointed pocket flap on each front.  The fronts and pocket flaps are made of ivory silk twill, the back of linen.  The waistcoat is lined with linen; the front skirts are ivory silk twill, and the front facings ivory silk taffeta. The waistcoat is appliquéd with white silk cord and embroidered-to-shape with silk floss in yellow and shades of green, blue and pink in a pattern of flowers and leaves with a trellised border, on the pocket flaps, collar and along the front edges and hems.  The fronts are embroidered with repeating floral sprigs.  There are 8 worked buttonholes along the left front with 5 (3 missing) embroidered buttons on the right front."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/4f6a7978-94c1-3f4d-8c34-d464d14380ad> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/98b93270-166d-3ffc-ba9b-4dfbb672c0de> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/4876a2cd-9924-3706-82bb-85604d888303> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/277793ff-3ebe-3862-828c-6adf64941fc7> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/9f582f76-1627-3d5a-b92a-687c9be47874> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/9a931214-1560-3960-b91d-75731d4989a5> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Man's court waistcoat, 1795-1800, English; ivory silk, embroidered coloured silks"@en , "Man’s court waistcoat with a 2-inch (5 cm) standing collar, straight fronts and skirts reaching to the top of the hip. There are no pockets, only a pointed pocket flap on each front.  The fronts and pocket flaps are made of ivory silk twill, the back of linen.  The waistcoat is lined with linen; the front skirts are ivory silk twill, and the front facings ivory silk taffeta. The waistcoat is appliquéd with white silk cord and embroidered-to-shape with silk floss in yellow and shades of green, blue and pink in a pattern of flowers and leaves with a trellised border, on the pocket flaps, collar and along the front edges and hems.  The fronts are embroidered with repeating floral sprigs.  There are 8 worked buttonholes along the left front with 5 (3 missing) embroidered buttons on the right front."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/b8e89245-ff4b-32e5-bbe7-87eff0b51f9b/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/b8e89245-ff4b-32e5-bbe7-87eff0b51f9b/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/b8e89245-ff4b-32e5-bbe7-87eff0b51f9b/dimension/1> ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.1089-1913" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
